OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed for head-on dual
OL,4,Acarriageway crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA detective has criticised a
OL,7,F67-year-old driver who denied a
OL,8,Fdangerous driving charge following a
OL,9,Fhead-on crash which left two people
OL,10,Fseriously injured.
OL,12,FGary Sandford, of Ashfield Drive,
OL,13,FLetchworth, Hertfordshire, was given a
OL,14,Ffour-year jail sentence after jurors
OL,15,Ffound him guilty of causing serious
OL,16,Finjury by dangerous driving following a
OL,17,Ftrial.
OL,19,FPolice said Sandford had driven his
OL,20,FMercedes on the "wrong side of the dual
OL,21,Fcarriageway".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
